    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "castus",
      "text": "The crowd... is silent. Strange. I always thought they would cheer."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Who gave you the shard, Castus? Who holds the next link?"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "castus",
      "text": "You think you broke the chain...? It only runs east."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "castus",
      "text": "Persia. The Shahbanu's court. She keeps an alchemist in chains there... Roxana."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "castus",
      "text": "The girl knows how the Crown was forged. They will never... let her go."
    },
